|---|-------|----------|--------|
| 1 | Missing Security Headers | Critical | Not Fixed |
| 2 | No Input Validation | High | Not Fixed |
| 3 | Info Disclosure (Stack Traces) | High | Not Fixed |
| 4 | No Rate Limiting | High | Not Fixed |
| 5 | No Authentication | High | Not Fixed |
| 6 | Exposed .env.test | Medium | Partially Fixed (in git) |
| 7 | No CORS Configuration | Medium | Not Fixed |

